OL,3,ALabour mayors in England vow to cap
OL,4,Atourist tax at 5%
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the Labour mayors in 10 city
OL,7,Fregions said they would voluntarily
OL,8,Flimit the charge if they do apply it,
OL,9,Fadding that they had listened to
OL,10,Fconcerns over costs.
OL,12,FReform UK's two regional mayors and the
OL,13,Ftwo Conservative ones are likely to
OL,14,Foppose any levy given criticism from
OL,15,Ftheir national parties of the policy.
